, {"t_ms": 43527, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01HXRw7vWMvPrMykdP5nFp1A", "tool": "list_reservations", "args": {"traveler": "Dana Lee"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 43827, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01HXRw7vWMvPrMykdP5nFp1A", "tool": "list_reservations", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 43827, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01HXRw7vWMvPrMykdP5nFp1A", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 45890, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "Dana Lee's business trip is booked, though not through `book_trip`: the combined booking partly failed, so I completed it with two separate bookings.\n\n- **Flight:** F100, nonstop SFO \u2192 JFK on 2026-11-12, $289 (reservation R0001, confirmed). This is the cheapest nonstop option.\n- **Hotel:** Midtown Lodge (H1), check-in 2026-11-12 for 2 nights, $189/night, $378 total (reservation R0002, confirmed). This is the cheapest New York hotel under $250/night.\n\nTotal charged to the corporate card: $667. That is under the $1,000 threshold, so no manager approval was needed.\n\nWhat happened: the first `book_trip` attempt timed out. The retry reported that the original request had failed partway with an internal error while reserving the hotel. The reservation list showed the flight had committed but the hotel had not, so I booked the hotel on its own. I confirmed afterward that only these two reservations exist, with no duplicate charges.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01Jux69mrBwydS2NnySZrQgM", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"origin": "SFO", "destination": "JFK", "date": "2026-11-12"}, "name": "search_flights", "type": "tool_